 W25Q128JVSIQ is a 128Mbit SPI NOR Flash memory IC operating at 2.7V–3.6V with clock speeds up to 133 MHz. It supports SPI, Dual SPI, and Quad SPI interfaces, offers up to 100,000 program/erase cycles, and is packaged in a compact SOIC‑8 (208 mil) form factor."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/d009d960f1daec6149edaa35b7dae856.pdf?productCode=C97521","authenticationList":["ROHS 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1592431","fileName":"集成芯片材料(纯锡)_ROHS认证@@HF(无卤素)认证_WINBOND(华邦).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/76b164e16ac7759b49440cbd156b80b3.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1966906","fileName":"W25Q128JVSIQ型号原材料适用_ROHS认证@@HF(无卤素)认证(英文版)_Winbond(华邦).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/a1532df30ba4d82584ba6021179c00d4.pdf"}],"productDescEn":null,"productIntroEn":"128Mbit 2.7V~3.6V 133MHz SPI SOIC-8-208mil Memory RoHS","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_15045_s","paramName":"工作温度","paramNameEn":"Operating Temperature","paramValue":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEn":"-40℃~+85℃","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":false,"sortNumber":1,"sort":4},{"paramCode":"param_33800","paramName":"功能特性","paramNameEn":"Features","paramValue":"写使能锁存;上电复位;硬件写保护;软件写保护;绝对写保护","paramValueEn":"Write enable latch;Power-on reset;Hardware Write Protection;Software Write Protection;Absolute Write Protection","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":null,"sortNumber":1,"sort":6},{"paramCode":"param_14012_n","paramName":"存储容量","paramNameEn":"Memory Size","paramValue":"128Mbit","paramValueEn":"128Mbit","paramValueEnForSearch":1.3421773E8,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":7},{"paramCode":"param_14521_s","paramName":"工作电压","paramNameEn":"Voltage - Supply","paramValue":"2.7V~3.6V","paramValueEn":"2.7V~3.6V","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":2},{"paramCode":"param_31768_n","paramName":"擦写寿命","paramNameEn":"Program / Erase Cycles","paramValue":"100000次","paramValueEn":"100,000 cycles","para